# Currency display (`DS-MONEY-01`)

- Storage/API: ISO codes (`RUB`, …).
- UI: never print the literal `RUB` — use **`₽`** via `currencySymbol` / `formatAmountWithCurrency` from `frontend/lib/money.ts`.
- Selects: `value` stays ISO; option label uses `currencyOptionLabel`.
- Canonical doc: `docs/design-system/currency-display.md`.
